cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "uringpy: a GIL-aware io_uring runtime for CPython"
authors:
  - family-names: Velayutham
    given-names: Marimuthu
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
keywords:
  - io_uring
  - asyncio
  - Python
  - GIL
  - free-threading
  - event-loop
  - multicore
abstract: >-
  A completion-reaping io_uring runtime for CPython that drives the
  accept/recv/send protocol inside a single nogil C region, enabling worker
  threads to scale across cores within one interpreter where asyncio-family
  loops collapse under GIL contention. Includes reproducible single-node and
  two-node benchmarks and a GIL-vs-syscall isolation probe.
